msgid "Refund from {site_name}"
msgstr "Pengembalian dana dari {site_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:230
msgid ""
"Order ID: {order_id}\n"
"Order Date: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"You're receiving this email because we have processed your refund of {last_refund_amount}. It can take up to 10 days to appear on your statement, if it takes longer please contact your bank for assistance."
msgstr ""
"ID Pesanan: {order_id}\n"
"Tanggal Pesanan: {order_date}\n"
"\n"
"Anda menerima email ini karena kami telah memproses pengembalian dana Anda sebesar {last_refund_amount}. Ini bisa memakan waktu hingga 10 hari untuk muncul di laporan Anda, jika memakan waktu lebih lama silakan hubungi bank Anda untuk bantuan."

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:242
msgid "Your {product_name} trial is about to end"
msgstr "Percobaan {product_name} Anda akan segera berakhir"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:246
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Your trial is ending on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Once your trial is complete, we will automatically charge the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"To cancel your trial, please log in to <a href=\"{login}\">your account</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Hai {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Percobaan Anda akan berakhir pada <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>. Setelah percobaan Anda selesai, kami akan secara otomatis membebankan metode pembayaran yang kami miliki untuk <strong>{order_amount}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Untuk membatalkan percobaan Anda, silakan masuk ke <a href=\"{login}\">akun Anda</a>.\n"
"\n"
"Terima kasih,\n"
"{site_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:265
msgid "Upcoming payment reminder for {product_name}"
msgstr "Pengingat pembayaran mendatang untuk {product_name}"

#: includes/email/ppcart-template-functions/templates.php:269
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Just a friendly reminder that we will be automatically charging the payment method we have on file for <strong>{order_amount}</strong> on <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"If you have any questions regarding your upcoming payment, please don't hesitate to get in touch.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you,\n"
"{site_name}"
msgstr ""
"Hai {customer_firstname},\n"
"\n"
"Ini adalah pengingat ramah bahwa kami akan secara otomatis membebankan metode pembayaran yang kami miliki untuk <strong>{order_amount}</strong> pada <strong>{next_bill_date}</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan mengenai pembayaran mendatang Anda, jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami.\n"
"\n"
"Terima kasih,\n"
"{site_name}"

